    {
      "source": "Tool indexes are cached across turns of the same conversation: re-indexing only occurs\nwhen the tool set changes (detected via a fingerprint of tool names and descriptions).\nStale session indexes are cleaned up according to the configured\n<a href=\"../../../../tool/toolsearch/eviction/ToolIndexEvictionStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.toolsearch.eviction\"><code>ToolIndexEvictionStrategy</code></a>.",
      "translation": "工具索引在同一对话的不同轮次中会被缓存：仅当工具集发生变化时（通过工具名称和描述的特征指纹检测）才会重新索引。过期的会话索引将根据配置的<a href=\"../../../../tool/toolsearch/eviction/ToolIndexEvictionStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.toolsearch.eviction\"><code>ToolIndexEvictionStrategy</code></a>进行清理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Call this when a conversation is known to be over (e.g., on logout or session\nexpiry) to free resources held by the underlying <a href=\"../../../../tool/toolsearch/ToolIndex.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.toolsearch\"><code>ToolIndex</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在已知对话已结束时（例如登出或会话过期）调用此方法，以释放底层<a href=\"../../../../tool/toolsearch/ToolIndex.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.toolsearch\"><code>ToolIndex</code></a>持有的资源。",
      "count": 1
    },
