    {
      "source": "CallAdvisor that integrates a tool search mechanism into the tool calling workflow. It\nindexes available tools at the start of a conversation, exposes a \"toolSearchTool\" for\nsearching tools based on natural language queries, and manages the selection and\ninjection of discovered tools into the conversation flow.",
      "translation": "CallAdvisor 将工具搜索机制集成到工具调用工作流中。它在对话开始时索引可用工具，提供一个名为 \"toolSearchTool\" 的工具以支持基于自然语言查询的工具搜索，并管理发现工具的选中与注入到对话流程中的过程。",
      "count": 1
    }
